Spec: Menu Data

Purpose:
  Keep dishes, descriptions, prices and their category-to-image association consistent.

Owns:
  ./menu.json
  ./menu.ts

References:
  /src/assets/menu/menu.sdd

Must:
  Category IDs are unique and each resolves to an existing image.
  Prices are non-negative integer euro cents.
  Original dish descriptions and both bocadillo and montado prices are preserved.
  Image captions and text sections derive from the same category objects.

Done when:
  Data validation and source-preservation tests pass.
